  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional master programme in integrated water     resources management (IWRM) in the SADC region    WaterNet Phase IIb - WATERNET Phase IIb</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regional masterutbildning i integrerad            vattenresursf&#xF6;rvaltning i SADC-regionen           WaterNet Fas IIb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaterNet is a master program which offers training modules in integrated water resources management in southern Africa. The lectures are given by staff from member institutions (universitites) in the region. 5 year program, phase II, also supported by the Dutch. Acc to agreement, WaterNet Trust new agreement partner for final part of program, since they are now legal entity. Phase IIb 2009-2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WaterNet &#xE4;r ett program som ger magisterutbildning inom integrerad vattenresursf&#xF6;rvaltning i s&#xF6;dra Afrika. Utbildningen g&#xF6;rs av medlemsinstitutioner (universitet) i regionen. 5-&#xE5;rigt program, phase II, &#xE4;ven st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Holland. Enl &#xF6;k &#xF6;vergick avtalet och resterande del av impl av phase II till WaterNet Trust n&#xE4;r dom fick juridisk status. Avtal f&#xF6;r phase IIb 2009-2011.</narrative>
  </description>
